      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-63427",
      ":question/problem": "The following frequency table shows the number of apps, grouped by price, sold by a computer programmer over a certain period. How many apps were sold for at least $$150$?\n\n| Price ($$$) | Number of Apps |\n| --- | ---: |\n| $50 - 99$ | $14$ |\n| $100 - 149$ | $9$ |\n| $150 - 199$ | $13$ |\n| $200 - 249$ | $10$ |"
